   without asking, and never create users or forge a session cookie to get past it.
+  In Firefox DevTools, `fill_by_uid` scrambles an ISO date in `<input type=date>` (`2099-01-01` became
+  `9010-09-20`), so read `.value` back; `confirm()` auto-cancels, so stub `window.confirm` in `evaluate_script`.
 - **Scripts:** one-off Node scripts go in `scripts/` as `.mts`, run with `node --no-warnings scripts/<name>.mts`
